Thermography is a mobile tool that supports direct connection with the infrared thermal imager wifi to view videos. It has functions such as real-time video preview, controlling the thermal imager, full screen high and low temperature tracking, adding analysis objects, taking photos, recording, generating PDF reports, email, sharing, image editing, video playback, etc.
1. Real time video preview, which can watch the video transmitted from the thermal imager in real time, realize full screen high and low temperature tracking, send control commands to the thermal imager, and add functions such as analysis objects, photography, and video recording;
2. Picture browsing, which can save photos, videos and pictures and videos directly downloaded from the thermal imager. It also supports PDF report generation, email sending, sharing and report printing functions for infrared pictures;
3. Picture editing, which can analyze infrared pictures, add analysis objects, modify picture information, and add notes, including text notes, photo notes, voice notes, and graffiti notes.

Thermography是一款支持与红外热像仪wifi直连查看视频的手机端工具，具有实时视频预览、控制热像仪、全屏高低温追踪、添加分析对象、拍照、录像、生成PDF报表、邮件、分享、图片编辑、录像回放等功能。
1.实时视频预览，可实时观看热像仪传输过来的视频，并实现全屏高低温追踪，向热像仪发送控制命令，添加分析对象、拍照、录像等功能;
2.图片浏览，可保存拍照、录像和从热像仪直连下载的图片视频，同时支持对红外图片生成PDF报表、发送邮件、分享和报表打印功能;
3.图片编辑，可对红外图片进行分析，添加分析对象，修改图片信息，添加注释，包括文本注释、拍照注释、语音注释和涂鸦注释。
